                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "30e64f0b-6fab-4716-a1e7-160504191fad",
                        "entry_id": "3daa0113-7c49-342f-8133-1f7e356542a1",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "conventicles"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "760b1e9f-b818-3eff-8c56-385ee62f7774",
                        "entry_id": "3daa0113-7c49-342f-8133-1f7e356542a1",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A secret, unauthorized or illegal religious meeting."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "92a9164c-5ab9-4494-8ac8-be5bb1235917",
                                "sense_id": "760b1e9f-b818-3eff-8c56-385ee62f7774",
                                "text": "[I]f when Luther firſt began to teach new doctrine, the catholiks at that time had not vouchſafed to giue him the hering, but had auoided his prechings & preuy couenticles, ther had not bin now in the worlde, either Lutheran, Swinglian, Calueniſt, Puritan, Anabaptiſt, Trinetarie, Family of loue, Adamite, or the lyke: whereof now there are ſo many thouſands abroad, al ſpringing of that firſt ſecte, and troubling at this day the whole worlde, […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6ccb42f3-d4da-4bc2-a8d3-638ccd780af1",
                                "sense_id": "760b1e9f-b818-3eff-8c56-385ee62f7774",
                                "text": "If publique Aſſemblies of Divines cannot agree upon a right vvay, private Conventicles of illeterate men, vvill ſoon finde a vvrong. Bivious demurres breed devious reſolutions. Paſſengers to heaven are in haſte, and vvill vvalk one vvay or other."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "82a90fe2-9553-4377-86c4-bcf23c149378",
                                "sense_id": "760b1e9f-b818-3eff-8c56-385ee62f7774",
                                "text": "In the meantime, Lord Avonleigh found a wonderful resource in being loyal; he attended county meetings, denounced the Puritans, discouraged conventicles, discountenanced long graces or long sermons, and was seized with a sudden veneration for the church as established by law, which led to fines and imprisonment on all absentees from worship as ordained by law."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e1bc89a1-e690-38c8-a256-f4af1faa240e",
                        "entry_id": "3daa0113-7c49-342f-8133-1f7e356542a1",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The place where such a meeting is held."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "57d03831-3bee-33f2-9da1-779c7424ae87",
                        "entry_id": "3daa0113-7c49-342f-8133-1f7e356542a1",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A Quaker meetinghouse."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1fbf5058-9093-4f7a-aef0-543640a6d4ec",
                        "source_entry_id": "3daa0113-7c49-342f-8133-1f7e356542a1",
                        "source_sense_description": "secret, unauthorized, or illegal religious meeting",
                        "target_lang_word": "conventicule",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "conventicule",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "61c980d5-9f6e-34a7-ac6e-70d2a20847df",
                                        "entry_id": "3ea696ca-282a-329f-8d07-719d370755e4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Petite assemblée en général secrète et illicite."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8a829364-ee37-4a97-a537-e289bd7424dc",
                                                "sense_id": "61c980d5-9f6e-34a7-ac6e-70d2a20847df",
                                                "text": "Ces conventicules sont encore plus pernicieux, s’ils sont des confédérations illicites, ou s’ils imposent le serment du silence le plus strict."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a9d1be03-6ca6-4eec-93d4-3ab9205b7256",
                                                "sense_id": "61c980d5-9f6e-34a7-ac6e-70d2a20847df",
                                                "text": "La violence de cette prose et ses contrastes à la Bruegel sont destinés à nous amener à une conclusion dévote, où, sous une lumière un peu fade, les saints et les fidèles d’un conventicule confits, si l’on peut dire, en Dieu, échappent au malheur humain."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a08a91aa-eb21-4511-9d44-c96770744b53",
                                                "sense_id": "61c980d5-9f6e-34a7-ac6e-70d2a20847df",
                                                "text": "Le Grand Café Déchenole et des Ambassadeurs était plus que jamais le théâtre d’une agitation fébrile et de conversations animées, au lendemain de cette mémorable séance. On commentait interminablement, dans les conventicules réunis autour des tables de marbre, les événements survenus chez le notaire."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
